  "pages": [
    {
      "type": "patchouli:spotlight",
      "item": "theoreticalsciences:essence_distillery",
      "title": "Essence Distillery",
      "text": "A tower of fractionation trays wound with chronosteel coils. Pour in every fluid one mod has and it boils them together, tray after tray, until what is left is a single fluid that stands for all of them: that mod's Essence.$(br2)$(thing)Tier 5$() machine."
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "text": "This controller is too complex for a crafting grid. Build it on the $(item)Femtoscale Assembly Line$() - check JEI for the exact parts."
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "text": "Distils every fluid of one mod into that mod's $(fluid)Essence$(), and the Essences, with water and lava, into $(fluid)Anima Mundi$(), one of Pleroma's five fluids. JEI lists, mod by mod, which fluids go in."
    },
